# Text the binary embeds (include_str!) or its tests compare byte for byte
# stays LF in every checkout. With Git's Windows default (core.autocrlf), the
# instructions `init --agent` manages were embedded with CRLF, so the block it
# wrote never compared equal to the next run's, and the docs test found no
# JSON example after its heading.
src/setup/instructions.md text eol=lf
src/setup/opencode.js text eol=lf
site/src/*.md text eol=lf
